  "title": "Dually Deluxe Camper",
  "date": "2023-06-27",
  "excerpt": "Olympus Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "Elevating the Olympus build tier to new heights, this sprinter van conversion is built on a powerful Mercedes Sprinter Dually, promising robust towing capabilities courtesy of its additional wheels. It's not just about practicality, though—beauty is ingrained in every feature, from the exquisite mosaic-tiled shower to the stylish dark mirrored backsplash near the sink.",
    "More than just a visual masterpiece, this van packs serious power, boasting 800Ah of Lithium Ion Batteries and a 300W solar system. The result? You can keep the adventure going in the desert for days without worrying about your power supply."
